ient (different projections) can be;\n","- **patient-grouped**: the correct protocol.\n","\n","The gap between regimes estimates how optimistic leaky protocols are on CADICA. The severity model is used here; Section 11.1 repeats the experiment for the detector."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":16,"id":"ab9d56e1","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-08T20:03:31.224147Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-08T20:03:31.22365Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-08T20:36:46.643542Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-08T20:36:46.64262Z"},"papermill":{"duration":1995.445081,"end_time":"2026-11-08T20:36:46.648508+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-08T20:03:31.203427+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["  leakage frame_random seed0 fold0 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed0 fold1 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed0 fold2 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed0 fold3 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed0 fold4 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed1 fold0 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed1 fold1 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed1 fold2 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed1 fold3 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed1 fold4 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed2 fold0 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed2 fold1 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed2 fold2 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed2 fold3 done\n","  leakage frame_random seed2 fold4 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed0 fold0 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed0 fold1 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed0 fold2 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed0 fold3 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed0 fold4 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed1 fold0 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed1 fold1 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed1 fold2 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed1 fold3 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed1 fold4 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed2 fold0 done\n","  leakage video_grouped seed2 fold1 done\n","  leakage